  "narrative": {
    "intro": "Caddell Construction Co de has $524M in contract obligations for FY2026 to date. Caddell Construction Co de has 20 awards this fiscal year, with an average award size of $26.2M. Caddell Construction Co de's obligations are up 145.2% year over year. Caddell Construction Co de received obligations from multiple fiscal years: FY21 totaled $231M, FY22 totaled $2.2B, FY23 totaled $31.1M, FY24 totaled $979M, FY25 totaled $214M, and FY26 totaled $524M. The Department of State is the top buyer for FY2026 to date with $524M in obligations. The Department of Defense appears as a buyer with $43.2K in obligations for the same period. All figures are contract obligations except award-value figures noted elsewhere, and current-year totals are partial because the fiscal year is ongoing. This overview focuses on obligations and buying agencies to help government contractors and acquisition teams quickly see Caddell Construction Co de's recent federal footprint.",
